{"seq":3,"slug":"binary-frameworks","title":"二进制框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/binary-frameworks","wordCount":712,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"二进制框架\">二进制框架</h1><p>当模块化项目规模增长到一定程度，源码编译时间会成为瓶颈。二进制框架通过预编译分发模块来大幅缩短构建时间。本文介绍 XCFramework、远程二进制缓存以及预编译分发策略。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>二进制框架的核心是<strong>用预编译产物替代源码编译</strong>，围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>XCFramework</strong>：苹果推出的多平台二进制分发格式，单个包可同时包含多架构（arm64、x86_64）与多平台（iOS、iOS Simulator、macOS）产物</li>\n<li><strong>二进制缓存</strong>：把编译结果缓存到本地或远程，命中时跳过重编译</li>\n<li><strong>预编译分发策略</strong>：决定哪些模块以二进制形式交付、如何版本化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相比早期的 Fat Binary，XCFramework 用目录结构统一管理多平台切片，避免了架构冲突。它的代价是调试符号与源码可见性的取舍，因此通常只对稳定的底层模块启用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"xcframework-概述\">XCFramework 概述</h2><p>XCFramework 是苹果推出的多平台二进制分发格式，支持在单个包中包含多架构（arm64、x86_64）和多平台（iOS、iOS Simulator、macOS）的产物。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Source[&quot;源码模块&quot;] --&gt; Build[&quot;xcodebuild archive&quot;]&#10;    Build --&gt; iOS[&quot;iOS arm64&quot;]&#10;    Build --&gt; Sim[&quot;iOS Simulator arm64 + x86_64&quot;]&#10;    Build --&gt; Mac[&quot;macOS arm64 + x86_64&quot;]&#10;    iOS --&gt; XCF[&quot;XCFramework&quot;]&#10;    Sim --&gt; XCF&#10;    Mac --&gt; XCF&#10;&#10;    classDef src fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;    classDef build fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef arch fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef xcf fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0&#10;&#10;    class Source src&#10;    class Build build&#10;    class iOS,Sim,Mac arch&#10;    class XCF xcf\">graph TD\n    Source[\"源码模块\"] --&gt; Build[\"xcodebuild archive\"]\n    Build --&gt; iOS[\"iOS arm64\"]\n    Build --&gt; Sim[\"iOS Simulator arm64 + x86_64\"]\n    Build --&gt; Mac[\"macOS arm64 + x86_64\"]\n    iOS --&gt; XCF[\"XCFramework\"]\n    Sim --&gt; XCF\n    Mac --&gt; XCF\n\n    classDef src fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n    classDef build fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef arch fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef xcf fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0\n\n    class Source src\n    class Build build\n    class iOS,Sim,Mac arch\n    class XCF xcf</pre><p>构建 XCFramework 的命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 构建脚本示例（在 Package.swift 或 Makefile 中使用）&#10;// Step 1: 针对各平台 archive&#10;// xcodebuild archive -scheme CoreNetworking -destination &quot;generic/platform=iOS&quot; -archivePath ./build/ios SKIP_INSTALL=NO&#10;// xcodebuild archive -scheme CoreNetworking -destination &quot;generic/platform=iOS Simulator&quot; -archivePath ./build/sim SKIP_INSTALL=NO&#10;&#10;// Step 2: 合并为 XCFramework&#10;// xcodebuild -create-xcframework \\&#10;//   -framework ./build/ios.xcarchive/Products/Library/Frameworks/CoreNetworking.framework \\&#10;//   -framework ./build/sim.xcarchive/Products/Library/Frameworks/CoreNetworking.framework \\&#10;//   -output ./build/CoreNetworking.xcframework\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 构建脚本示例（在 Package.swift 或 Makefile 中使用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Step 1: 针对各平台 archive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// xcodebuild archive -scheme CoreNetworking -destination \"generic/platform=iOS\" -archivePath ./build/ios SKIP_INSTALL=NO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// xcodebuild archive -scheme CoreNetworking -destination \"generic/platform=iOS Simulator\" -archivePath ./build/sim SKIP_INSTALL=NO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Step 2: 合并为 XCFramework</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// xcodebuild -create-xcframework \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   -framework ./build/ios.xcarchive/Products/Library/Frameworks/CoreNetworking.framework \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   -framework ./build/sim.xcarchive/Products/Library/Frameworks/CoreNetworking.framework \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   -output ./build/CoreNetworking.xcframework</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"fat-binary-与-xcframework-对比\">Fat Binary 与 XCFramework 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Fat Binary (lipo)</th>\n<th>XCFramework</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多架构支持</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多平台支持</td>\n<td>❌（需手动分离）</td>\n<td>✅（原生支持）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App Store 提交</td>\n<td>需剥离模拟器架构</td>\n<td>自动选择正确架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPM 集成</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>苹果推荐</td>\n<td>❌（已弃用）</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 从 Xcode 12 开始，Apple 强烈推荐使用 XCFramework 替代传统的 Fat Binary。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"远程二进制缓存\">远程二进制缓存</h2><p>远程二进制缓存将编译产物存储在云端，团队成员和 CI 可以直接下载预编译结果而无需重新编译。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Dev1[&quot;开发者 A&quot;] --&gt;|推送二进制| Cache[&quot;远程缓存&quot;]&#10;    Dev2[&quot;开发者 B&quot;] --&gt;|拉取二进制| Cache&#10;    CI[&quot;CI 服务器&quot;] --&gt;|推送/拉取| Cache&#10;    Cache --&gt; S3[&quot;S3 / GCS / 自建服务&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef dev fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef cache fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef storage fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class Dev1,Dev2 dev&#10;    class Cache,CI cache&#10;    class S3 storage\">graph LR\n    Dev1[\"开发者 A\"] --&gt;|推送二进制| Cache[\"远程缓存\"]\n    Dev2[\"开发者 B\"] --&gt;|拉取二进制| Cache\n    CI[\"CI 服务器\"] --&gt;|推送/拉取| Cache\n    Cache --&gt; S3[\"S3 / GCS / 自建服务\"]\n\n    classDef dev fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef cache fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef storage fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class Dev1,Dev2 dev\n    class Cache,CI cache\n    class S3 storage</pre><h3 id=\"tuist-缓存方案\">Tuist 缓存方案</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Tuist 项目中启用远程缓存&#10;// tuist fetch   — 从远程下载预编译框架&#10;// tuist cache   — 将编译结果上传到远程缓存&#10;// tuist generate — 使用缓存生成项目&#10;&#10;import ProjectDescription&#10;&#10;let project = Project(&#10;    name: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;    targets: [&#10;        .target(&#10;            name: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;            destinations: .iOS,&#10;            product: .app,&#10;            bundleId: &quot;com.example.myapp&quot;,&#10;            sources: [&quot;Sources/**&quot;],&#10;            dependencies: [&#10;                .external(name: &quot;CoreNetworking&quot;),&#10;                .external(name: &quot;SharedUI&quot;),&#10;            ]&#10;        )&#10;    ]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Tuist 项目中启用远程缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tuist fetch   — 从远程下载预编译框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tuist cache   — 将编译结果上传到远程缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tuist generate — 使用缓存生成项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProjectDescription</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> project </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            destinations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .iOS,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .app,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            bundleId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.myapp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            sources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Sources/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">external</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CoreNetworking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">external</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SharedUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自建缓存服务\">自建缓存服务</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct BinaryCacheService {&#10;    let storageURL: URL&#10;    let httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol&#10;&#10;    func upload(framework: XCFramework, version: String) async throws {&#10;        let data = try framework.archived()&#10;        let key = &quot;\\(framework.name)-\\(version)-\\(framework.hash).xcframework.zip&quot;&#10;        try await httpClient.upload(data, to: storageURL.appending(path: key))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func download(name: String, version: String) async throws -&gt; URL {&#10;        let manifest = try await httpClient.get(&#10;            storageURL.appending(path: &quot;\\(name)-\\(version)-manifest.json&quot;)&#10;        )&#10;        let cacheKey = manifest.cacheKey&#10;        let localPath = FileManager.default.temporaryDirectory.appending(path: cacheKey)&#10;        try await httpClient.download(&#10;            from: storageURL.appending(path: cacheKey),&#10;            to: localPath&#10;        )&#10;        return localPath&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BinaryCacheService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storageURL: URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> upload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">framework</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: XCFramework, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style