n style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">binaryTarget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Analytics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Frameworks/Analytics.xcframework\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>XCFramework 是苹果推荐的多平台二进制分发格式，取代了传统 Fat Binary</li>\n<li>远程二进制缓存可以将团队的增量编译时间从分钟级降低到秒级</li>\n<li>Tuist 等工具提供了开箱即用的远程缓存集成方案</li>\n<li>预编译分发策略应根据项目规模和团队需求灵活选择</li>\n<li>SPM 的 <code>.binaryTarget</code> 支持通过 URL 或本地路径引入预编译框架</li>\n<li>混合模式允许在源码调试和快速编译之间灵活切换</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"二进制框架","id":"二进制框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"XCFramework 概述","id":"xcframework-概述"},{"level":2,"text":"Fat Binary 与 XCFramework 对比","id":"fat-binary-与-xcframework-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"远程二进制缓存","id":"远程二进制缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Tuist 缓存方案","id":"tuist-缓存方案"},{"level":3,"text":"自建缓存服务","id":"自建缓存服务"},{"level":2,"text":"预编译分发策略","id":"预编译分发策略"},{"level":2,"text":"SPM 二进制 Target","id":"spm-二进制-target"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SPM 模块化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/spm-modularization"},"next":{"title":"接口模块模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/interface-module-pattern"}}